            </note>
            <note corresp="#d267-f2" n="2" xml:id="d267-f2-content">
                <p>Regarding this meeting, see <ref target="#d266">Document 266</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d267-f3" n="3" xml:id="d267-f3-content">
                <p>North Vietnam formally rejected the 17-nation proposal in a statement issued on
                    April 19. For text, see <hi rendition="#italic">Recent Exchanges Concerning
                        Attempts to Promote a Negotiated Settlement of the Conflict in Vietnam,</hi>
                    Cmnd. 2756 (London: Her Majesty’s Stationery Office, 1956), pp. 63–65.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
